<title>USA: San Antonio feeder cattle fully steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>San Antonio feeder cattle fully steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were fully steady, compared to Monday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Bulk of supply Medium and Large 1-2 300-600 lb feeder steers and heifers. Supply included around 15 percent cows and bulls, 25 percent feeder cattle over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 500-600 lbs 75.50-85.50, two pkgs 86.00-90.00; 600-700 lbs 72.00-77.00, pkg 86.00; 700-750 lbs 69.00-76.50; few 800-925 lbs 65.00-74.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 500-600 lbs 70.25-80.00, two pkgs replacement quality 85.50-86.00; 625-725 lbs 66.25-73.50, pkg replacement quality 78.00. Medium and Large 1-2 - 300-600 lbs 63.00-72.00, pkg 77.00; two pkgs 750- 950 lbs 53.00-57.00.</p>
<p>Receipts - 269    Last Week - 172   Last Year - 1,031</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
